      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A patient is described in whom a previously unstenosed single coronary artery was complicated 12 months later by anterior myocardial infarction. Full clinical features documented by exercise thallium scintigraphy and coronary angiography before and after myocardial infarction are described."},
